{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今日（11月19日）盛大舉行！每年台慶最備受網民及傳媒矚目的環節，絕對是一眾花旦女星在紅地氈上的爭妍鬥麗。今年全台女藝員再次傾巢而出，以最吸睛、最性感的晚裝造型亮相紅毯。本文將為你緊貼直擊《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈盛況，一網打盡各大視后大熱、一線花旦及新生代小花的絕美打扮！邊個最性感搶鏡？邊個衣著大出事？即睇全場最靚女星造型圖輯及高清相片！</p><figure><img alt=\"魔音女團（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200154993873653760246893.jpeg/TeXOzj9rpx-ZNfjGMiUHVWi_c50merwRljOG57Mzhuc\"/><figcaption>魔音女團（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155019916611584174825.jpeg/5MJMgF469UWGXYlZlqXB4AHDrUB7VreDV1_Ey3JfxMs\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155016883998720918632.jpeg/o486yQyOYud1scpwl1sXIWBJLgM5J5yxduOOflPjjn4\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155013767499776172345.jpeg/H9JYt5wOsEJvOI8FMvjtqcUcwNe7UNr9Qh2ol2cdqJc\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155010495811584582907.jpeg/cvNT-bXNR8cweU2-2zzu7mH7JoJXn8mRTxRg2moUYNo\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155007224123392067431.jpeg/o20zmpb_ORACEQgdeOtfBxduU76n9AlnkrducLe3bnA\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155020419928064021596.jpeg/eswdHYWdaE3tRg29NvYrVIvRWVatdTzcC0JuwC5CbsA\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊思明（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155017383120896735064.jpeg/hZWy5a-t8QrIiIdYeLvxCl7yc9T6G4DFhnU9TqN1PU4\"/><figcaption>莊思明（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳敏之（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155014019158016246981.jpeg/8YspqXb7N9wtwlxcwumKv6IFlsVBD